    {
        *rcNameID: =USER_DEFINED_SIZE_DISPLAY
        *MinSize: PAIR(140, 293)
        *MaxSize: PAIR(733, 11811)
	*MaxPrintableWidth: 696
	*CustPrintableOriginX:  %d{18}
	*CustPrintableOriginY:  %d{35}
	*CustPrintableSizeX:   %d{PhysPaperWidth-36}
	*CustPrintableSizeY:  %d{PhysPaperLength-70}
	*CustCursorOriginX:  %d{18}
	*CustCursorOriginY:   %d{35}
